        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SHP29, Early American Shell Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid brass, this early american style shell cabinet handle is great for drawers, furniture, or cabinet doors. It is surface mounted with matching finish exposed screws to the door's face in the classic early american style. This Deltana made cup pull has a overall length of 4-1/8 inches and a 3-5/8 inch center to center mounting. Each cabinet handle includes matching finish screws for easy installation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-SHP29-size.gif?v=1704354578\" width=\"564\" height=\"161\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SHP29 Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/3-1-2-inch-oval-cup-cabinet-handle-deltana-k43\"><b>Oval Shell Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-elongated-shell-cabinet-handle-deltana-k407\"><b>Elongated Shell Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SHP29 Shell Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Centers: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SHP29.pdf?v=1691095377\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SHP29 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the cabinet handle will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Early American Shell Cabinet Handle | Deltana SHP29",
                "description": "Early American Shell Cabinet Handle Deltana SHP29 - Made of solid brass, this early american style shell cabinet handle is great for drawers, furniture, or cabinet doors. It is surface mounted with matching finish exposed screws to the door's face in the classic early american style. This Deltana made cup pull has a overall length of 4-1/8 inches and a 3-5/8 inch center to center mounting. Each cabinet handle includes matching finish screws for easy installation. Available in 7 beautiful finishes. ",
